      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good question.\n\nI think ideally we\u0027d force this to wrap, but I can\u0027t figure out the right combination of CSS incantations to make that happen on a \u003cpre\u003e\u003ccode\u003e block at the moment. \n\nFailing that, I think a horizontal scrollbar + a fixed width block would work, something like adding:\n\n    pre {\n      overflow-x: scroll;\n      max-width: 80em;\n    }\n    \nto //site/_stylesheets/default.scss should work okay for now.",
      "parentUuid": "b4525230_417e94ff",
